WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:30.760
Breaking the ceasefire,

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:35.360
even Duker Iq's Motorad cruiser "M" which attacked the White Ark...

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:38.730
...was no match for Üso and the others' Gundam team.

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:41.660
And the V2 Gundam...

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:45.700
...began to demonstrate power apparently lying hidden within.

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.900
THE SONG OF THE WINGS OF LIGHT

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:53.830
"The Song of the Wings of Light".

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:10.460
We've entered Europe.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:13.030
Since BESPA's Largaine base is still active,

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.560
we'll remain on combat alert from here on.

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:18.500
Elisha, don't take your eyes off the radar.

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:19.260
Right!

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:23.660
Yeah, we fixed it so the missiles can be fired...

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.460
...either from here or the bridge.

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.660
Good job. I'll help!

00:02:27.860 --> 00:02:29.600
What about the Gun Blaster?

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:30.930
It's not working right.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:35.300
Odelo, there's a ceasefire on. We can't attack.

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:37.830
Yeah, and you tend to be careless about that.

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:41.130
You shouldn't drive away the guy who has a guardian angel on his side.

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:42.960
You have a guardian angel?

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:45.500
She kissed me!

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:47.630
You and Miss Elisha?!

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.430
You keep trying, though.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:53.430
Damn you, BESPA! Come at me! I dare you!

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:08.530
We're home, Mom.

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:12.060
If they'd just declared the ceasefire five minutes sooner,

00:03:12.130 --> 00:03:14.460
you wouldn't be coming home like this.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:17.360
Mom!

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:18.760
Üso...

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.900
Reach your hand out, and I'll save you!

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:36.960
Aircraft, sighted.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.100
During a ceasefire?!

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:41.030
The whole thing may as well be a lie!

00:03:41.060 --> 00:03:43.800
Three Overhead Hawks at 10 o'clock!

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:45.560
Üso, not so fast!

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:51.560
They're not attacking?

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.960
Üso, observe their movements.

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:55.400
They've vanished.

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:58.300
And they weren't on course for Largaine?

00:03:58.460 --> 00:03:59.230
Right.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:01.800
Recalling V2.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:04.360
Let's change our landing point.

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:19.700
Üso, wait! Haro!

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:20.730
Shahkti!

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.860
Watch your step.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:23.700
Right!

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.100
Are you sick?

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:28.860
It smells like rotting grass. Doesn't it stink to you?

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.860
This is the best season here, though.

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:33.860
Even with this choking stink?!

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:36.160
It's better than Hiland...

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:37.330
I hate it!

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.930
I can never marry her...

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.600
Is this Kasarelia place very far?

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.830
It's just past that mountain.

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:49.030
Odelo, we found a wappa!

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:51.630
Wow, it still works?

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:53.560
It should get us over the mountain.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.030
How about that one?

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:57.430
It's usable.

00:04:57.460 --> 00:05:01.700
Üso, we just got orders from the Reineforce Junior to head for Largaine.

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:04.860
You can go to Kasarelia, but be back soon.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.160
Wait! Wait!

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:07.760
Hey!

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:09.600
Why don't you come with us?

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:11.660
Even though I'm not used to this place yet?

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:14.260
Wait for me!

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:32.000
The ceasefire's between our Empire and the Federation.

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:34.400
It's got nothing to do with the rebels.

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:38.360
If that's the League Militaire that set down by the lake,

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:40.130
do we attack them?

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:43.530
Largaine has a score to settle with them.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:45.460
We attack the white suit.

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:49.600
That's why we snuck away from the base without surrendering.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.230
But, Lieutenant Mathis,

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:55.000
weren't they the ones who hit the Motorad Fleet so hard?

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:58.630
If it's the little ship the Overhead Hawks reported,

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:00.360
we can crush them with our number.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:05.330
On the other side of the stars,

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:11.660
there lies the future.

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:18.200
The young ones...

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:26.130
...spread their wings of dreams.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:39.630
As they scatter the red poppy blossoms,

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:50.760
setting out on their journey.

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:58.260
What peaceful singing.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:02.700
This must be a nice place if children are living here.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:08.330
We'll head for the lake where that little ship landed!

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:17.930
Well?

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:20.730
Doesn't look like anything's been taken from Üso's place, either.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.800
Gonna be hard to get the fields back in shape.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.160
We'll manage.

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:28.460
If everyone works together...

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:29.330
Huh?

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:30.960
A sun shower!

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:32.330
"Sun shower?"

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:34.060
Also known as a fox's wedding.

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:35.100
A fox's...

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:36.760
Or, maybe not.

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:38.860
Is that what's causing the rain?

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:40.730
Causing the rain?

00:07:40.830 --> 00:07:42.430
Something's kicking up a spray!

00:07:45.130 --> 00:07:47.830
That's the White Ark using its shield at the lake!

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:49.400
What's wrong?

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:50.130
Üso!

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:52.530
Shahkti, you guys, stay here!

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:54.730
What are you doing?!

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:58.260
Odelo, you guys head back! I'm going to...

00:07:58.300 --> 00:07:59.160
Gotcha!

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.430
What about Üso?

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:03.360
He'll use his paraglider.

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:04.660
Paraglider?

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:09.000
Fighting in Kasarelia...

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:19.800
The White Ark's under attack!

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:33.330
Some flappy thing is coming towards us!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:34.930
It's Üso's paraglider!

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:36.630
Send out V2!

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:37.830
Mister!

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:40.260
Karel, release V2's fastening hook!

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:41.360
Y-Yes, sir!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:48.130
What?! I'm supposed to jump on in midair again?!

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:55.260
Is the white one so shaken and eager to fight that it fell off?!

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.900
Miss Marbet, protect the White Ark!

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:22.200
What? That waterspout!

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:35.000
Don't bring the war to Kasarelia!

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:48.000
It's nothing! Just an explosion!

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:55.930
Did Üso just do that?

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.230
One unit, downed.

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:59.030
Üso's getting stronger.

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:02.130
Because V2's so much better, right?

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.660
No, that's not it.

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:08.460
Because Üso himself is getting so much better.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:10.500
He needs to be careful.

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:16.900
That was meant to be a warning shot! How could he not dodge that?!

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:19.760
Are Zolos that slow?

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:23.600
Is the white one out of ammo? Then I'll pick him off!

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:34.630
If we push him into point M.W., we can carry out the plan!

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:36.200
Don't damage this land!

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:47.000
Okay, the white one's got its hands full!

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:49.130
I'm going after it! Cover me!

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:51.930
Miss Marbet!

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:52.860
One's on our tail!

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:54.660
Is Üso not moving fast enough?!

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.930
That's it! Fly right into the trap we've laid!

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:15.330
Miss Marbet, never mind us! Leave us behind!

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.860
I can't let anything happen to you, Elisha!

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:19.330
Miss Marbet?

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:22.200
No! There's also the wappa with Odelo and the others!

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:26.160
Get out of here!

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.430
Why is Üso missing?!

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:37.030
Miss Marbet, bring Odelo and the others to the aft cargo bay!

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:38.400
There he goes again!

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.060
All right!

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:41.500
Miss Elisha, you first!

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:42.660
Right.

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:45.230
I'm fine.

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:48.160
Miss Marbet, I'll head out, too! Give me a hand!

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:49.360
Here's your hand.

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:52.530
Get inside!

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:53.730
Right!

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.230
Don't do anything crazy!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:59.330
Üso, we've pulled away from Kasarelia.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:02.230
Now, shoot them down! You can handle these guys!

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:04.030
But, they're so weak!

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:08.460
An enemy prepared to die will find skills he never thought he had!

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:10.960
Even if you say so, I...

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:15.460
It drives me crazy to think that this is the enemy that killed my mom!

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:21.500
Üso's running?

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:25.800
If coming home has taken all the fight out of him, then I'll fight them!

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:31.130
Even I can do this!

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:37.300
Just hang on a little longer. They're coming!

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:43.700
They're here! We'll flank the white one!

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:45.700
Behind you, towards the ship!

00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:59.100
How dare you!

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:02.230
Light like this killed my mom!

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.630
Brake! We're going to hit the ground!

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.160
Brace yourselves!

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:11.360
You can use me as a cushion!

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:15.860
Here it comes!

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:32.760
M.W.! Are you ready? We're driving them towards you!

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.100
What?! Their movement's changed!

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:40.600
Are they avoiding us? They're running?

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:42.660
Tomáš, stop!

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:46.530
Don't chase them so far when you don't have to!

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:48.600
Back up Tomáš, Üso!

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:50.230
Shake a leg!

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:51.700
Why?!

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:57.500
Yes, Lieutenant Mathis, we can move out anytime.

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.160
Got your Boots!

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:25.760
There are reinforcements?!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.030
It docked!

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:40.430
Did I screw up?!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:51.500
Tomáš!

00:14:51.960 --> 00:14:53.030
It was a trap?!

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:54.760
Tomáš!

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:55.960
Come in!

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:56.960
Big brother!

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:57.960
Tomáš!

00:14:58.030 --> 00:14:59.460
I'll contact the Reineforce!

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:01.300
Can't we help him?!

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.330
Reineforce!

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:05.260
Raise the output to maximum and send a laser transmission!

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:10.360
Why are they using so much?!

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:14.900
The Federation is taking all our weapons under the ceasefire agreement!

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:18.900
Use them all up here! This is our last stronghold!

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:22.400
Tomáš! Fly higher!

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:26.730
My hands won't move! What's going on?!

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:28.060
Try falling!

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:29.560
Falling?!

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:43.400
They just keep coming!

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:46.360
Wounded enemies who have accepted death are this terrifying?

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:50.030
They're like I was when I tried to stop that Motorad ship!

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:53.760
You alone are the League Militaire's symbol!

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:01.460
No, you don't! Elisha and Martina are there, too!

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:06.630
Kill one and a second will follow! Kill the second and a third will follow!

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:08.700
You can't kill us with one blow!

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:12.700
They're charging! They're trying to die honorably by ramming us!

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:13.830
Ramming us?!

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:17.160
Firing cannon!

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:18.560
Also firing missiles!

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:19.700
Launch!

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:33.760
I can't let another nuclear blast happen!

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:37.160
What now, Üso?! What should I do?!

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:41.730
Üso, they'll pick you off!

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:44.900
I'm not going to die! Nobody's going to die!

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:47.130
Did we hit the white one?!

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:53.600
Maximum power!

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.800
Light wings... That big?!

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:13.500
What?! When they pass through that light...

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:14.460
Evade!

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:19.960
There are mega particles between the light wings?!

00:17:26.630 --> 00:17:28.430
V2's light wings!

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:30.760
He can use them like that?

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:32.700
T-That's amazing, Üso!

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:39.400
Even if I'm the last one, I'm taking you with me!

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:52.430
There's still a strong one left! What kind of person is he?

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:03.800
Wings of light, flying over the land meant for my wife and children!

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:08.760
How could the guerrillas have made those wings?!

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:11.600
Üso, there's no time to hesitate!

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:19.000
He's strong!

00:18:21.400 --> 00:18:22.760
STAND ASIDE!

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:31.330
I won't die so easily!

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:35.960
DIE WITH ME!

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:45.700
You can still escape! Why aren't you-

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:47.460
If you people had never come,

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:50.400
my daughters could have lived in a peaceful land!

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:54.830
What? We only came to monitor the ceasefire!

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:59.560
Rebels like you, with two of those white monsters!

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:01.030
How can you say that?!

00:19:01.060 --> 00:19:03.660
I'm coming over, okay?!

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:08.600
The war's over!

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.560
We don't have to fight!

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:18.060
Hang on, please!

00:19:19.030 --> 00:19:20.960
Üso, you got him!

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:24.430
What's a child like you doing here?

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:27.960
The suit's gonna blow! We have to get out of here!

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:33.460
When I heard that singing... I wanted this to be my new home.

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:37.060
But the adults you're with had to wreck everything!

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:38.060
Singing?

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:42.100
I think the lyrics mentioned poppies...

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:45.600
It was like something my daughters would sing...

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:47.760
Mr. Pilot!

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:52.160
We can talk later!

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:55.260
I can't let a man like you die!

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:25.760
You heard me!

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:29.830
We'll head to Largaine after we've dug the graves here in Kasarelia!

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:33.160
Otherwise, we can't cooperate with you from here on!

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:35.130
We're not leaving Kasarelia!

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:37.700
Come on, let's dig the graves.

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:38.900
Okay, then.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:46.230
She's with Mr. Oliver and the girls from Shrike Team, too.

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:47.000
Yeah.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:51.060
Üso, shall we put the Zolo pilot's grave here?

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:52.400
Y-Yeah.

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:56.560
He was Lieutenant Mathis Walker, BESPA pilot from Largaine base.

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:03.030
Shahkti, sing that song you always do.

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:04.560
What? Sure.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:10.630
On the other side of the stars,

00:21:12.130 --> 00:21:17.100
there lies the future.

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:23.930
The young ones...

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:31.500
...spread their wings of dreams.

00:21:32.230 --> 00:21:44.800
As they scatter the red poppy blossoms,

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:46.100
Karl...

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:55.760
setting out on their journey.

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:32.160
The sound of bells befalls us.

00:23:33.100 --> 00:23:36.860
As Üso delivers Mr. Mathis's family to Kasarelia,

00:23:36.900 --> 00:23:39.830
they engage a gigantic mobile suit and its beam.

00:23:40.360 --> 00:23:43.830
It's a power unlike any they've yet encountered.

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:49.530
The BESPA attack begins to inflict pain on the White Ark all the more!

00:23:50.100 --> 00:23:53.000
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.460 --> 00:23:56.560
Next Episode BENEATH THE ULTRA-HIGH ALTITUDE ATTACK
"Beneath the Ultra-High Altitude Attack".

00:23:56.560 --> 00:23:57.900
Please watch it!
